<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Clothed in light as with a garment,</l><l>Crowned with majesty divine,</l><l>Lo, the scepter of dominion</l><l>Now and ever, Lord, is Thine.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>O the greatness of Thy mercy,</l><l>And the richness of Thy grace!</l><l>O the love that in Thy kingdom</l><l>Is preparing me a place!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>When at last I reach the kingdom,</l><l>Win the crown, the battle o’er,</l><l>With ten thousand times ten thousand</l><l>I shall sing forevermore.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
